{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a7629aa9dc5a833d9e0e","chatId":"f9b3e6e5c4b54ca4bcaf18d03701cb2e","sessionId":null,"userId":99598,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":5097,"promptTokens":515,"completionTokens":156,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:47:46"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068159861510182,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7629aa9dc5a833d9e0d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484066701,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:47:46","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a7629aa9dc5a833d9e0d","chatId":"f9b3e6e5c4b54ca4bcaf18d03701cb2e","sessionId":null,"userId":99598,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n父亲去世后，小珀得到了应得的遗产份额。小珀的哥哥以会替她保管为由拿走了这份遗产。然而，小珀并不知道，哥哥实际上是把这笔遗产用于自己的私利了。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小珀最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 反对 & 没意识的\nB) 感激 & 没意识的\nC) 生气 & 紧张\nD) 没意识的 & 紧张\nE) 感激 & 生气\nF) 期待 & 反对\n\n## 问题 2\n小珀为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 小珀不知道她的哥哥把她的资产用于私利 & 她的兄弟背叛了她的信任\nB) 留下遗产的是她的父亲 & 她的兄弟背叛了她的信任\nC) 小珀不知道她的哥哥把她的资产用于私利 & 她的兄弟有不诚实的过去\nD) 小珀不知道她的哥哥把她的资产用于私利 & 小珀感到感激，因为她哥哥愿意帮她管理父亲的遗产\nE) 她的兄弟愿意帮助她管理遗产 & 她的兄弟有不诚实的过去\nF) 她的兄弟有不诚实的过去 & 小珀知道她的兄弟会背叛她的信任","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068159861510182,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7629aa9dc5a833d9e0e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484066698,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:47:46","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"9c2e87a6d3cb4450abc710870136df66"}